    here is equivalent to a combination of :func:`~torch.fft.fft` and
    :func:`~torch.fft.rfft`:

    >>> two_ffts = torch.fft.fft(torch.fft.rfft(t, dim=1), dim=0)
    >>> torch.testing.assert_close(rfftn, two_ffts, check_stride=False)

